WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.538
The AVFS dataset comprises six hundred thirty-eight
thousand quality-controlled triplet

00:00:05.618 --> 00:00:10.576
judgments over four thousand nine hundred
twenty-one near-frontal face images.

00:00:10.656 --> 00:00:17.034
Every single judgment carries the annotator's
identifier and self-identified demographic attributes.

00:00:17.114 --> 00:00:21.231
The authors evaluate on held-out judgments over the
same stimuli,

00:00:21.311 --> 00:00:24.783
on eighty thousand judgments over entirely novel faces,

00:00:24.863 --> 00:00:30.660
and against attribute-recognition baselines trained
on CelebA and FairFace semantic labels.
